Modifications for ValTraining / CA-VAL-AIM (2026): rebranding (ValTraining in
1.16.1, CA-VAL-AIM in 1.18.0), additional map geometry, sealed collision and a
spawn audit, collision and movement fixes, Vandal/Phantom and full-arsenal weapon
behaviour, sensitivity tools (including the micro-adjustment Sens Finder),
reaction-time, tracking, flick, micro and reflex drills, deathmatch bots, a live
coach, a minimalist interface with its own sound settings, Spanish UI and release
packaging.

